  "description": "Harkin & Associates are delighted to bring new to the rental market 31A Beecher Street, Mallow, Cork.\n\nStunning New-Build A0-Rated 2-Bedroom Semi-Detached Home – First Letting\nA rare opportunity to rent a brand-new, exceptionally energy-efficient two-bedroom home in a prime location on Beecher Street, right in the heart of Mallow.\nThis beautifully finished 980 sq. ft. semi-detached home is being offered for its first letting, with everything completely new. Bright, spacious and contemporary throughout, the property combines the comfort of a modern new build with an excellent town-centre location.\n\nThe heart of the house is the large open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, featuring a generous fitted kitchen, breakfast bar and a full range of brand-new appliances including fridge/freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob, microwave and washer/dryer.\nThere are two large double bedrooms, both with substantial fitted wardrobes and excellent storage. The house has been designed with modern living in mind, with plenty of sockets and TV points throughout and several suitable areas for a home-office/workstation setup.\nThe large contemporary bathroom features a wet-room-style power shower and modern finishes throughout.\n\nExceptionally Energy Efficient\nWith an A0 BER rating, this is an exceptionally efficient and comfortable home designed to have very low running costs.\nFeatures include air-to-water heating, underfloor heating, sophisticated mechanical heat-recovery ventilation (MHRV), triple-glazed windows, excellent airtightness and high levels of insulation.\nOutside is a private south-facing rear garden, which is not overlooked and has been designed to be virtually maintenance-free.\n\nLocation, Location, Location\nThe property enjoys an excellent position on Beecher Street, with shops and a range of everyday services on the street and Mallow town centre only a short walk away.\nMallow Train Station is approximately a 5-minute walk, while the town centre is also approximately 5 minutes on foot. The property is conveniently positioned close to the Cork/Limerick road network, making it particularly suitable for commuters, with Cork approximately 25 minutes by car depending on traffic.\nAdditional features include ample on-street parking, modern lighting throughout and a full furniture package.\n\nKey Details\n2 large double bedrooms • Approx. 980 sq. ft. • A0 BER • Fully furnished • First letting • Brand-new appliances • South-facing private garden • Underfloor heating • Air-to-water heat pump • MHRV • Triple glazing • Excellent storage • Ample on-street parking • No pets permitted\n31A Beecher Street offers something rarely available on the Mallow rental market — a completely new, A0-rated home within walking distance of the town centre and train station.\n\nPLEASE REPLY VIA DAFT.IE WITH A BRIEF BIO.\n",
